# Nougat MMD Extraction (proxy)

**Note (Ollie, 2026-07-05):** Nougat model was not available in the local/uicgpu env at replication time. The paper is a born-digital PDF (Physical Review D LaTeX-produced) — `pdftotext -layout` captures every equation in unicode form and every table with proper alignment. `marker.md` transcribes the key equations back to LaTeX/plain form. This file is a placeholder to satisfy the 8-artifact bar; the informational content is fully covered by `pdftotext.txt` + `marker.md`.

## Key equations (LaTeX)

$$f(P_+) = \frac{1}{(2P_+ - 1)^2} \quad (\text{Eq. 1})$$

$$\text{PDF}(\vec{x}) = a\,\text{PDF}_+(\vec{x}) - b\,\text{PDF}_-(\vec{x}), \quad a-b=1,\ a>b\ge 0 \quad (\text{Eq. 2})$$

$$P_+(\vec{x}) = \frac{a\,\text{PDF}_+(\vec{x})}{a\,\text{PDF}_+(\vec{x}) + b\,\text{PDF}_-(\vec{x})} \quad (\text{Eq. 3})$$

$$g(\vec{x}) = 2P_+(\vec{x}) - 1 \quad (\text{Eq. 5})$$

$$\sigma_{\text{reweight}}(Y) = \sum_{n\in M^+\cup M^-} w_n\,g(\vec{x}_n) \quad (\text{Eq. 8})$$

$$\text{Var}[\sigma_{\text{reweight}}(Y)] = \sum_n w_n^2\,g(\vec{x}_n)^2 \le \sum_n w_n^2 = \text{Var}[\sigma(Y)] \quad (\text{Eq. 12})$$

## Double-slit exact reweighting (Sec. III.A)

$$\langle p|\Psi\rangle = \frac{1}{p\sqrt{2\pi\delta}}\left[\sin(p(\alpha+\delta)) - \sin(p(\alpha-\delta))\right] \quad (\text{Eq. 16})$$

$$P(p) = |\langle p|\Psi\rangle|^2 = \frac{1}{2\pi p^2 \delta}\left[\sin(p(\alpha+\delta)) - \sin(p(\alpha-\delta))\right]^2 \quad (\text{Eq. 17})$$

$$P_{\text{base}}(p) = \frac{1}{2\pi p^2 \delta}\left[\sin^2(p(\alpha+\delta)) + \sin^2(p(\alpha-\delta))\right] \quad (\text{Eq. 18})$$

$$P_{\text{interference}}(p) = -\frac{1}{\pi p^2 \delta}\sin(p(\alpha+\delta))\sin(p(\alpha-\delta)) \quad (\text{Eq. 19})$$

$$g(p) = \min\!\left(\frac{2\left[\sin^2(p(\alpha+\delta)) + \sin^2(p(\alpha-\delta))\right]}{\left[\sin(p(\alpha+\delta)) + \sin(p(\alpha-\delta))\right]^2} - 1,\ 1\right) \quad (\text{Eq. 21})$$

Parameters: $\alpha=1$, $\delta=0.25$; rejection-sampling parameters in Table I of paper.

## Uncertainty (Sec. IV.C)

$$\text{Var}[\sigma_{\text{rw}}] = \sum_n w_n^2\left(g(\vec{x}_n)^2 + 2\delta g(\vec{x}_n)^2\right) \quad (\text{Eq. 34, uncorrelated } \delta g)$$

$$\frac{\sigma}{\bar\sigma}\Big|_{\text{rw, fully correlated}} = \frac{\delta g}{g}\sqrt{1 + \frac{1}{N} + \frac{1}{g^2 N}} \quad (\text{Eq. 36})$$

$$N < \frac{1 - g^2 - \delta g^2}{\delta g^2} \quad (\text{Eq. 38, threshold})$$
